WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.999
Geometry becomes behavior. Change a gate load. Follow the same oxide into capacitance, logic margins and loaded delay.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.999
A read must earn trust. Follow actual operand bytes. A detected double-bit error prevents publication of the matrix result.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.999
Boundaries before batches. Trace source families, train-only token merges and the causal targets that a packed batch exposes.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.999
Weights that actually learn. Train the bounded decoder. Inspect its changed attention, target probabilities and real gradients.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.999
One objective, many owners. Unequal examples need the right denominator. Complete every owned shard before committing an update.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.999
Verify before accepting. Reuse computed keys and values. Reject a wrong proposed prefix and rebuild only the valid target state.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.999
A reference becomes a proposal. Fitted embeddings select context. A small conditional decoder generates a typed reservation proposal.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.999
Inspect what really happened. A lost reply can hide a committed write. Recover its receipt and check the actual environment.

9
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.999
Prediction meets consequence. Fit dynamics, inspect candidate futures and compare the chosen action with the state that follows.

10
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.999
Keep the work that survives. Carry learned weights through admission, a partial checkpoint write, rollback and durable recovery.
